Pending drivers cannot start authorized trips.
Rejected drivers cannot start authorized trips.
Verify assigned bus and driver before starting a trip.
Validate all submitted information.
Record important actions in an audit log.

Use a clearly labelled demo role switcher until real authentication is configured.

ACCEPTANCE TESTS
