Admin can approve a driver.
Admin can reject a driver.
Unapproved driver cannot start a trip.
Approved driver can start an assigned bus.
Driver cannot update another driver's bus.
Bus status updates are reflected in the student dashboard.

Implement the working functionality and preserve all previous modules.
